  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Only the translational kinetic energy of disc changes into gravitational potential energy and rotational <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KE</mi></math> remains unchanged as there is no friction.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
